}

### Email Verification (public link)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email/{id}/{hash}

### Document Verify (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/verify/{{tokenDocVerify}}
Accept: application/json

### Protected Routes (use Authorization header)

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSuperAdmin}}
Accept: application/json

### Logout All Sessions
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout-all
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSuperAdmin}}
Accept: application/json

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSuperAdmin}}
Accept: application/json

### Current User
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TokenSuperAdmin}}

